  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Social Protection Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A new component for resilience programming supporting shock responsive social protection through Malawi&apos;s national social protection mechanism. The funds will be channelled through World Bank&apos;s Multi Donor Trust Fund which will support reform efforts aimed at delivering structural change in Malawi&apos;s approach to poverty alleviation and expanding social protection will be important for Malawi to weather future macroeconomic and climate shocks by providing a conduit to channel funding to the poorest.</narrative>
  </description>
